@translation unitary en project
@unit 1
@span 1 - 6
Gudea, ruler of Lagaš, who built the temple of Ninŋešzida and the temple of Ŋeštin-ana.

@unit 2
@span  i 1 - iii 5
For Ŋeštin-ana, the lady ..., the beloved spouse of Ninŋešzida, his lady, Gudea, ruler of Lagaš, built her temple in Ŋirsu. He fashioned his statue, named it for her sake "Ŋeštin-ana looked at him with favour", and brought it before her into the temple.



